  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e03-scene-23",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "冰美式不加糖  (Iced Americano With No Sugar)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "qin_xiao": "秦箫",
    "kaiwen": "凯文",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Stepping out of the conference room as the newly hired assistant to the DTS network supervisor, Qin Xiao spots Bu Xiaogu working as an office assistant and places a pointed drink order. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "传媒学院的学生毕业以后，首选工作一般是在电视台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "像这样选择做行政的，倒是很少见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "请问你负责泡咖啡吗？这个很重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们主任不喜欢喝咖啡，请你每天泡一杯红茶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我的话，冰美式就可以了，不加糖。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "麻烦你记下来，因为以后我们很有可能会常驻星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "虽然现在暂时停播整改，但是我们肯定要拍下一季的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "凯文，我听说淳于总把你们制作一部打造成一部超级机器。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行啊，随时欢迎你们看一看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您的冰美式不加糖，谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "传媒学院的学生毕业以后，首选工作一般是在电视台。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For Media College graduates, the first-choice job is usually at a television network.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "像这样选择做行政的，倒是很少见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Choosing administrative work like this is quite rare.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "请问你负责泡咖啡吗？这个很重要。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Excuse me, are you in charge of making coffee? That is very important.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我们主任不喜欢喝咖啡，请你每天泡一杯红茶。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Our director dislikes coffee, so please brew a cup of black tea every day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "我的话，冰美式就可以了，不加糖。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As for me, an iced Americano will do, with no sugar.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "麻烦你记下来，因为以后我们很有可能会常驻星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please write that down, since we will very likely be stationed at Xingtian long term.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "虽然现在暂时停播整改，但是我们肯定要拍下一季的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Although the show is paused for review right now, we will definitely film a next season.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "凯文，我听说淳于总把你们制作一部打造成一部超级机器。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Kaiwen, I hear Chun Yuqiao built Unit One into a super machine.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "行啊，随时欢迎你们看一看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sure thing; you are welcome to watch us anytime.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "您的冰美式不加糖，谢谢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Here is your iced Americano with no sugar, thank you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "qin_xiao",
      "t": "传媒学院的学生毕业以后，首选工作一般是在电视台。",
